      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "134 declarative rules (static_checker.json)\neach: title · curl · regex · severity 0-10\n\nreplays the curl, then matches the regex against the\nresponse exactly as `curl -i` prints it —\nstatus line, headers, blank line, body\n\na match is a finding, with the matched bytes as evidence",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
