      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "pi-agent-core loop, one turn at a time\ntools: run_curl · record_finding · finish_scan\n\nrolling 20-message window so context stays bounded,\nwith findings.md pinned into every request as memory\n\nstops on finish_scan, a bare STOP, or after 20 turns",
